      "field": "content",
      "operation": "add",
      "after": "<h1>关卡02 首次进入大厅</h1><h1><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4663ce8e3f4018ed0bd96ec8fd6e519761ad58359d4e912645897d0cf80e7a34.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">前往大厅<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/96751f8760cbeae00a7ee2274db844d01bbaff232f02a0b405a32a99b2ae8b7a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">电箱谜题：每个引脚颜色对应一次加减，合计为+12即可解锁音频【拼图】</div></div></div><div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/68ce51dcb71239baad3b2848d7c4c56906a987759630e0e6c25160a1544157a8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">【视界探测器】音频听取到Igor</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/62e80a604ff6be00fc8e5321563c82b0ca41b5a3a339a681c669e4aee18d3f7e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">在黄圈内播放【拼图】音频，听取到Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b388202cd79e4009ee5e04aa6529aff0a144672fd7c246fa83fe47e9453e05f8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">大厅电脑：Igor Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dd756f59b35b18918b363bf0f2c48c8b9724a8e3432eaf86aa7a980c2a6d77ba.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">更新K9，升级无接触门禁系统（解锁储物柜、连接器等）</div></div></div></div></div></h1><h3><span>依次前往舱段打开AMAAN储物柜（获取今年生日日期）、厨房冰箱蛋糕蜡烛（获取年龄）、AMAAN房间（打开AMAAN保险库）</span></h3><h1><div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/d65a4e19b0000113e5e9ac51ce5d9ab6d2f8020de8948bd3952be05b4d8e960c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">今年生日日期：25/08/2466</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f4f442e89619d0ccf183c07fd9e9121eb869b5c29f21066dc856ed8eecfad111.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">60岁生日</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/7c70a156215d089c236302e42565274a856fe47c2d0db713dedc04c01175e696.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN生日：25/08/2406</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/133169bdc8d7b7e6c5aeb649def8a9f60a969df0345bc2584d56e66bf821692b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN保险库饮料：COSMIK!</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b232d07f5d5f4ebed52b8aa19a9cde5f0e534b8583d9b88ef4e8b97ca598ddde.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><div><span>根据AMAAN卧室3张语法说明，依次输入</span></div><div>LS</div><div>BUILD HYPERVIOLET.QB</div><div>COPY FLASHLIGHT.EXE MIRANDA.V<br></div><div>获取紫外光</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f0e8a27a1c5b98c71514df52a3cfb6c84bcdda41f3d2a8b66ce88a11c9dabe8e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">紫外照射</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/85333699669f8ceeecd7eafe4aa03b80ba26302f69adbd5a94cd160c1fd151bc.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN保险库</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/221392bfb15d45bf69f5df2fcdf989e65f6c72d8f4baec6747403eb4719d0896.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">厨房零食贩卖机</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c02849d3f5f473021783f1bcccc51dd14aac9e0adc120e466f5d6545ffbe776a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">AMAAN房间白板，紫外照射<br></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/d3d327411ba049a27f154a678b9c97010d25c2bf9510ae7c550ade414bb01921.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/a92bdd71df4182b4bfe819623fcb13d43a9a1d0f040f988648756456f9c513d0.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">从自动贩卖机获取【多重通行权】门禁卡</div></div></div></div></div></div></h1><h2>首次进入车库</h2><h1><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/01f95023c620c86a83fa37d707f45d0597d263947278c4b27c9556a9bf490085.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b68fc4d05158cc76288af1172bcf53280bdd30be1de36b76a80e83daa9a8dcc2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">1楼3个，2楼1个，全部插入船体并关闭，上2楼</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3a87a26d142cd5638fa834d514927f69e071c7b6e07694238be1924c9654ae80.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><div><span style=\"text-align: center\"><b>1.</b>ARES—SCRP-01—SCRP-02—AST-AR1—SDT-11—X-248—LUX-8—BTH-12—DATA-04</span><br></div><div><span style=\"text-align: center\"><b>2.</b>DATA-04—NNS-7—RE-005—VAN-26—ARK-18—X-303—Y-1KFT—Z-4MK—TIE-1—DATA-01</span><span style=\"text-align: center\"><br></span></div><div><span><b>3.</b>DATA-01—ORB-2—OA-9—AQ-94—GW-11—AW-13—SHFT-1—DATA-06—ATV-3—SA-X—MVL-30—ORE-X—VR-M—DATA-03</span><span style=\"text-align: center\"><br></span></div><div><span><b>4.</b>DATA-03—12B-0—P88-1—SPKT—ESA-6—DATA-02—CXO-X—11K-68—XM-R—EK-TE—ZX-2A—DATA-05</span><span><br></span></div><div><span><b>5.</b>DATA-05—SAS-11—EOS—MER-A—AUOS—RD-004—ARES</span></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/eb2fd366f8dc0ad5e560787bfcaac94c2c87a0d6f94d4df096633e468a6f5ec8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/514c2df824eb3f7e500b3bca46bd7d2990a19fd4bd12c029f398312fa2faf18b.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>车库1楼电脑桌右侧，拿着【输入板】到大厅的视界探测器，根据粒子波音频，</span></div><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span>在输入板上还原出6位数字顺序（随机），顺序播放音频给视界探测器</span><br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/ea1423845b021fcc070422edfad2b38fdfe8bb6b6fe093d6857728c31d1aa24d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">完成后，获取车库二楼电脑的EXNILON方案，前往使用</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4ed433a4f8edbddd25c913d0c726359ee3a1289a005921f02a874035197fca67.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">解锁车库二楼电脑，获取量子电池容器密码<br></div></div></div></div></div></div></h1><h2><b>首次前往连接器的实验室（左岔路）</b></h2><h1><div><div><div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/843003fc9b7e83bffe0eb4aba5550dc2d9f4b3b07a05c032e715564f2de9602f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">实验室密码提示：AION属于什么纲（之后获取）</div></div></div></div></h1><h2>首次前往连接器的观测站（右岔路）</h2><h1><div><div></div><div><img src=\"assets/837b8487108e64cb6c0a7feaf4516dcc1d50ebd319de456755071e64ad70c76d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dd1cf32b9bfd62dd73230901ca0889125341b8d33d1d8360a1f297b6ba19c854.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">Planta中心密码，AMAAN的可托（德）西林药物处方<br></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/c22991803ff55a27ad63398aa2684f10d1a7dd3e3526c2b9d06daed7d58c6f43.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3f374eccd9c31cddd2dc0094a0c0673594b354bf6c43865bc688ef32d032337a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div><img src=\"assets/3e6e930645e0aee417e8d2d5345a8c98c4180303f42bf3e5112596cf84e3f38c.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/6a2751ad2c3fb350357f3a7b10b3ec9374f48f5e7228493dddef032360357f10.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/7de439537a6a4873a8ecd33dd21c7fa74c1611370fd40d9f88617326311154c8.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/942aef19c59c96e1c75311f4aa985abc7e6e53b5f536687588efc9dfae72235e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">用于合成可托（德）西林药片，在AMAAN房间浴室</div></div><img src=\"assets/c9e4c7de499ab1c5b49b1f9a476d5d7f4f6b6dcb20c94d2814f6d2566475fbb1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/a0f39fca2df22f9146b2945ab148ac785f5800eecdc3be4c84aebbb5d3a8092d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">可托（德）药物提取于Mavors</div></div><img src=\"assets/1a1f23c49af39b2a4e88dfdc8444ca41cb66a61cfdac022971ed4befa64de025.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/6ce47557319614bc52988a8ca3103a4802cd761e07515a738c7907b3a02ed09e.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/405c7ad8feece64ab0aca09a3b7508bdeb1942b37a771a756d921366223714a7.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/3404a684348129e0a7accb6c6099676b217065b73541767605c67c97e0be493d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div></div></h1><h2>新一循环直奔连接器——实验室，提前插入量子电池（进入需要剩余2格电）</h2><h1><div><div></div><div><img src=\"assets/61f5c8d1dc6ac58904ba5ed7a998e292cdd51f0d7fc00655e49e7c5e6f313029.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"></div></div></h1><h2>集齐4个JK指纹</h2><h1><div><div></div><div><img src=\"assets/f08398bb22edfbbcbe7487e059eaff653a713fb3b9cf2d24c00974caf9c45d4d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/a75c85b358bb1cb2381db50375e213b7e8af8e25ccd113c79e0fcb2bdc0c09c9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/967bcef15cf025e5a54e481a8eaa1b257a463ff9ee3da23aa0589653f562eb87.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/5dde8c8b0e2f08893eecdd4c137048f29e15cf847978cf88599619efcdedd890.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/7861ab6a8b8964fd71fa8cd4b5270951470be5a9cb9341a336cdc444cba8f42d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/ae980c91a124ae0f2e250358bc7786e7c9de93376bf15311c2faca07bfdde15f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><img src=\"assets/f8fe2561390e10d41cc474acbb4871a32f145a7335d7d8f0df09330d7cb689fa.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/aa756bf99b60297ace50fa59fed360022f307843a58409c1963a85853387671a.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">集齐JK指纹，用于观测站解锁太阳能板</div></div></div></div></h1><h2>新一循环，不要使用量子电池，直奔连接器——<span style=\"text-align: center\">观测站</span></h2><h1><div><div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3d1c2712db9d16e2066494ed5ebae69ab01941c4ab9be16ad5a98d99223eee8f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">插入量子电池，验证指纹</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/ef6b76c05e6c10412a884aa24f02162ac52e9b538ac23b278e09606c2b2354a5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">谜题随机，连接电路，使得电源达到+2</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/5066c47a54091c154b7a0922d7a2c0b51524f06e2afc4d114f635a9d49280245.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">获取关卡03门禁卡信息，打印方法（在MIRANDA储物柜拿钥匙，培育区箱子破碎门禁卡，去打印）</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c3e003a0b6e0d21ada9014b88e6ea34319b914930251b11319d23cbe4a7cf05d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\">关卡03门禁卡</div></div></div></div></div></div></h1>"
